---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="First-Time Parents | Marietta Childcare"
  description="Explore how Marietta Childcare provides guidance, support, and developmental information for first-time parents.">
  <section class="relative py-32 overflow-hidden w-screen -ml-[calc((100vw-100%)/2)]">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img 
        src="/images/Background_Images/infant_tummy_time_teacher_hand_background.jpg" 
        alt="First-time parents" 
        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-20">
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-black mb-6 text-white drop-shadow-lg">First-Time Parents</h1>
      <p class="text-lg mb-12 max-w-2xl text-white drop-shadow-md">Guidance, support, and developmental information for first-time parents navigating childcare.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 px-6 lg:px-20">
    <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto">
      <article class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Support for First-Time Parents</h1>
        
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-8">Marietta Childcare provides comprehensive support for first-time parents. Marietta Childcare recognizes that new parents often have questions and concerns about childcare and child development.</p>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Guidance and Education</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare provides guidance to help first-time parents navigate early parenthood. Guidance at Marietta Childcare includes information about child development milestones. Marietta Childcare's staff shares knowledge about typical development and individual differences.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare educates first-time parents about healthy child development. Educational resources at Marietta Childcare address common parent questions. Marietta Childcare's guidance supports first-time parent confidence.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Developmental Information</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare shares detailed developmental information with first-time parents. Developmental information at Marietta Childcare covers cognitive, physical, social, and emotional growth. Marietta Childcare helps parents understand what to expect at each stage.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's developmental approach helps first-time parents recognize progress. Information at Marietta Childcare addresses developmental concerns and variations. Marietta Childcare's expertise supports first-time parent understanding.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Transition Support</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare supports first-time parents through the transition to childcare. Transition support at Marietta Childcare includes preparation for separation. Marietta Childcare's staff helps parents and children adjust to childcare routines.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's transition approach reduces first-time parent anxiety. Support at Marietta Childcare includes strategies for managing separation concerns. Marietta Childcare's compassionate approach supports first-time parent adjustment.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Communication and Updates</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare maintains frequent communication with first-time parents. Daily updates at Marietta Childcare keep first-time parents informed about their child's day. Marietta Childcare's communication includes photos and developmental observations.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's regular communication reduces first-time parent worry. Updates at Marietta Childcare help parents stay connected to their child's experiences. Marietta Childcare's transparent communication builds first-time parent trust.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Parent-Teacher Conferences</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare schedules regular parent-teacher conferences with first-time parents. Conferences at Marietta Childcare provide opportunities to discuss development and progress. Marietta Childcare's conferences answer first-time parent questions.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's conferences include developmental assessments and observations. Conference discussions at Marietta Childcare address first-time parent concerns. Marietta Childcare's collaborative approach supports first-time parent engagement.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Resources and Support</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare provides resources to support first-time parents. Resources at Marietta Childcare include parenting information and developmental guides. Marietta Childcare's staff recommends books and websites for first-time parents.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's resource library supports first-time parent learning. Support at Marietta Childcare extends beyond childcare to parenting guidance. Marietta Childcare's commitment to first-time parents includes ongoing education.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Safe, Nurturing Environment</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare creates a safe, nurturing environment for first-time parents' children. Safety at Marietta Childcare gives first-time parents peace of mind. Marietta Childcare's secure environment supports children's healthy development.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's nurturing approach helps children thrive. Nurturing care at Marietta Childcare supports secure attachment and emotional development. Marietta Childcare's environment is designed for first-time parents' comfort.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Infant Care Expertise</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare accepts children starting at 6 weeks old with expert infant care. Infant care at Marietta Childcare is provided by trained, experienced staff. Marietta Childcare's infant program supports first-time parents of babies.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's infant expertise includes responsive feeding and attachment support. Infant care at Marietta Childcare follows best practices in early development. Marietta Childcare's infant program gives first-time parents confidence.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-blue-50 p-6 rounded-lg mb-12">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Welcome to Parenthood</h3>
          <p class="mb-4">Marietta Childcare welcomes first-time parents and is committed to supporting your parenting journey. Contact Marietta Childcare to learn how Marietta Childcare can provide guidance and care for your family.</p>
          <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-blue-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-blue-700 transition">Schedule a Tour</a>
        </section>

        <nav class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Related Pages</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            <li><a href="/programs" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Our Programs</a></li>
            <li><a href="/faq/parent-communication" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">How Do You Communicate with Parents?</a></li>
            <li><a href="/faq/curriculum" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">What's Your Curriculum?</a></li>
            <li><a href="/about" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">About Marietta Childcare</a></li>
            <li><a href="/contact" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Contact Marietta Childcare</a></li>
          </ul>
        </nav>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
